/	SAMPLE TRAY OUT MESSAGE
/
TAL18,	CLB
	TAD SMTOUT	/IS THE SAMPLE TRAY OUT WHEN IT
	SNA CLA		/ IS NEEDED ?
	JMP TAL19	/NO, GO ON.
	DCA SMTOUT	/YES, FIRST CLEAR OUR FLAG.

	TAD TAL18M	/IS OUR MESSAGE BUSY ?
	SZA CLA
	JMP TAL19	/YES, FORGET IT.

	CLB IAC
	JMS NEWLIN	/CHECK FOR FULL PAGE
	CAL		/SEND OUT OUR MESSAGE
